---
title: Topics
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Browse a structured mechanistic interpretability curriculum, from transformer foundations through causal methods, features, circuits, tools, and AI safety.
permalink: /topics/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% set totalTopics = collections.learningPath | length %}
{% set totalBlocks = learningPath.blocks | length %}
{% set totalTextbooks = learningPath.textbooks | length %}
{% set firstTopic = learningPath.startHere %}

<div class="topics-page">
  <h1>Topics</h1>
  <p class="topics-description">Explore {{ totalTopics }} articles across {{ totalBlocks }} blocks{% if totalTextbooks > 1 %} in {{ totalTextbooks }} textbooks{% endif %}. Follow the suggested order, jump straight to the topic you need, or work backwards through an article's prerequisites until you reach ground you already have.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions topics-actions">
    <a href="/topics/{{ firstTopic.slug }}/" class="btn btn-primary">Start Learning</a>
    <a href="/glossary/" class="btn btn-secondary">Browse Glossary</a>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="features">
  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>{{ totalTopics }} articles</h3>
      <p>Each topic is a focused, standalone deep dive that still fits the larger sequence.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>{{ totalBlocks }} learning blocks</h3>
      <p>Topics are grouped by theme so you can build intuition before moving to advanced tools.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Suggested order</h3>
      <p>Read top-to-bottom for a guided path, or jump into any block whenever you need.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="learning-path">
  <div class="learning-path-content">
    <h2 class="learning-path-title">Curriculum Map</h2>
    <p class="learning-path-description">Browse every block and topic in the recommended sequence.</p>
    {% for textbook in learningPath.textbooks %}
    <section class="learning-path-textbook" id="{{ textbook.slug }}" style="--textbook-hue: {{ textbook.hue }};">
      <h3 class="learning-path-textbook-title">{{ textbook.title }}</h3>
      {% if textbook.description %}
      <p class="learning-path-textbook-description">{{ textbook.description }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      <ol class="learning-path-blocks">
        {% for block in textbook.blocks %}
        <li class="learning-path-block" id="{{ block.slug }}">
          <div class="learning-path-block-header">
            <span class="learning-path-block-number">{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="learning-path-block-title">{{ block.title }}</h4>
              <p class="learning-path-block-meta">{{ block.topics | length }} topics</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="learning-path-topics">
            {% for topic in block.topics %}
            <li class="learning-path-topic">
              <a href="/topics/{{ topic.slug }}/">{{ topic.title }}</a>{% if topic.status == "placeholder" %} <span class="topic-placeholder-tag">planned</span>{% endif %}
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
